1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 19=

34
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,920
You heard that?

35
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,840
That's wonderful.

36
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,240
If it can bring Shen Lang back to life,

37
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,760
I'll do anything.

38
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,880
Life and death follow their own destiny.

39
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,560
Though I can defy fate,

40
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,560
one life must be exchanged for another.

41
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,320
Ke Ayao,

42
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,280
you were born

43
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,700
under the purest yin conditions,

44
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:19,160
carrying the yin energy of heaven
and earth.

45
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:21,520
If you are willing
to give up your heart,

46
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,880
I can reunite you with him.

47
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,880
Heart?

48
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:29,320
I'll do it.

49
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,120
I thought

50
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,640
I would need some miraculous medicine,

51
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,320
but all it takes is my heart.

52
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,120
Without your heart,

53
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,040
how will you survive?

54
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,600
Even if you bring him back,

55
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,120
what meaning would that have?

56
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,840
Without Shen Lang,

57
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,960
I cannot go on living.

58
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,440
But without me,

59
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,760
he can still live.

60
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,560
That is the meaning.

61
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,240
Don't be foolish.

62
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,960
If it were your benefactor,

63
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,760
what would you do?

64
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,080
I...

65
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,360
Hey.

66
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,240
Are you alright?

67
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,840
Hey.

68
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,720
The devotion heart has been obtained.

69
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:34,280
When the demon dragon is born,

70
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:37,120
my fox clan will finally see the light
of day again.

71
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,200
Didn't you promise

72
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:40,000
to help her revive Shen Lang?

73
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,080
I only promised to reunite them.

74
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,360
Now that they are both dead,

75
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,120
they can naturally meet again
in the other world.

76
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,960
You deceived her!

77
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,640
So what?

78
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:48,840
Feeling sorry for her?

79
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:49,720
Don't forget,

80
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:52,720
the fox clan saved your life.

81
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:56,840
I wouldn't dare.

82
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:03,960
Ms. Ke,

83
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,520
your devotion to Shen Lang

84
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,920
will surely move heaven and earth.

85
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,200
In your next life,

86
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,280
you will surely be together.

87
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,160
Rest assured.

88
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:19,360
Even if heaven and earth stand
against you,

89
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,320
when my benefactor rules
the Three Realms,

90
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,520
I'll tell him

91
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,920
to reunite you both.

92
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,720
I, Su Ling'er,

93
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,720
always keep my word.

94
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,520
Rest in peace.

95
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,560
I will go save my benefactor now.

96
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,440
Alas...

97
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,760
Go in.

98
00:04:39,768 --> 00:04:40,582
(Zen)

99
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,360
Master.

100
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,200
I have incredible news!

101
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,200
What is it?

102
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,120
Huasheng Temple

103
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,680
has invited me to become the vice abbot!

104
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,480
Wow, what an opportunity!

105
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,840
You're finally making a name
for yourself.

106
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,240
But

107
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,080
don't worry.

108
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,680
I already turned it down.

109
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,000
Why?

110
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:55,280
Well...

111
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,800
Forget being an abbot,

112
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,680
even if the Jade Emperor

113
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,080
asked me to become an immortal,

114
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,200
I wouldn't go.

115
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:00,720
After all,

116
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,600
I can't leave you.

117
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,240
That's my boy.

118
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,600
Unlike some people,

119
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,800
(Zen)
heartless and ungrateful,

120
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,400
leaving without a second thought.

121
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:08,840
Leaving...

122
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,360
Leaving without a second thought.

123
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:13,640
Leaving without...

124
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,640
He just left?

125
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:17,960
Alas!

126
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:18,760
Looks like

127
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,120
Piaopiao's departure

128
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:22,360
really hurt him.

129
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,080
As a monk,

130
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,560
how can you make fun of someone's pain?

131
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:30,080
But you were the one who asked me
to come.

132
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,880
Since you're so obedient,

133
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,720
fine.

134
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,080
I'll send you right now

135
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,520
to die.

136
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:34,960
Hit the wall.

137
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,920
Die!

138
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,440
Go on!

139
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,840
Do it!

140
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:38,760
Good disciple!

141
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,200
Do it!

142
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,440
Go on!

143
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,680
Serves you right.

144
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,960
Why am I always the one getting
beaten up?

145
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,880
Wait, something's not right.

146
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:48,560
At least

147
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,400
no one is competing for my master's
attention anymore.

148
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:54,160
Getting beaten by my master feels
so good!

149
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,560
(Zen)
My happiness is back!

150
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,400
Benefactor,

151
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,760
I'm here to save you.

152
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,840
This time,

153
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,240
I brought you

154
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,520
soy sauce,

155
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,400
garlic,

156
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,840
scallions,

157
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:22,240
and Sichuan pepper leaves.

158
00:06:22,488 --> 00:06:23,422
(Three Lifetimes, Three Worlds.)

159
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,680
I thought I had forgotten my promise
to you.

160
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,480
Fate plays cruel tricks.

161
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,760
Yet it brought me to you again.

162
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,440
It's just a pity

163
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,400
that I didn't even get to say much
to you.

164
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,800
And you left just like that.

165
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,960
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

166
00:06:46,116 --> 00:06:47,396
(Three Three)

167
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,080
Celestial maiden Yanzhi.

168
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,400
What brings you here?

169
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:53,720
Because

170
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,200
I saw

171
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,640
that Her Majesty has
the celestial maiden Piaopiao

172
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,520
keeping her company.

173
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,680
I thought you must be

174
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,040
feeling a little lonely.

175
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,640
So I asked Her Majesty

176
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,000
for permission to come down
and keep you company.

177
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,080
No need.

178
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,640
I don't need anyone to comfort me.

179
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,480
No need.

180
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,080
Oh, come on.

181
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,000
It's nothing.

182
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,560
The last time

183
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,640
I came down to the mortal world,

184
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,880
Her Majesty was there,

185
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,680
so,

186
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,880
I had to hold myself back.

187
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:13,320
But this time,

188
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,600
I can finally have some fun.

189
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,360
Exactly.

190
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,480
(Three Three)
Huh?

191
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,920
Three Three?

192
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,840
Who is that?

193
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,440
Oh, I know.

194
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,920
If you wrote

195
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,000
someone's name

196
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,000
down,

197
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:28,880
that person must either

198
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:29,680
owe you something,

199
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,080
or

200
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:30,960
you owe them something.

201
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,360
Like

202
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,240
money or something.

203
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,120
Is it?

204
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,000
Exactly, exactly.

205
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,040
Then why don't you go find them?

206
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,720
Because

207
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,760
we had a little misunderstanding before.

208
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,160
And

209
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,160
in this vast world,

210
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,760
I don't even know

211
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,840
where to find them.

212
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,960
Oh.

213
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:52,880
But

214
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,880
I believe fate has a way.

215
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,360
It will surely allow me

216
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,400
to see that person again.

217
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,360
What was that sound?

218
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:05,920
Oh no.

219
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,280
Something bad is about to happen.

220
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:09,160
Hey!

221
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,080
Wait for me!

222
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,080
Little fox,

223
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,280
what are you doing?

224
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,240
I'm here to save my benefactor.

225
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:16,880
Huh?

226
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,040
Ah!

227
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,680
Look!

228
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,640
What are you looking at?

229
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,960
Well...

230
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,040
Hmph.

231
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,960
You must be scared silly

232
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,120
by my power.

233
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,480
How did you end up looking messier
than me?

234
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,280
Ah!

235
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,000
I...

236
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,680
Why is my skin so dark?

237
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,320
Maybe

238
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,400
you got stained by Qi just now.

239
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,360
Stained? What are you talking about?

240
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,040
You had the righteous path,

241
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,760
but you refused to take it.

242
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:01,800
You insisted on following
the demonic path.

243
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,300
Who knows what tricks

244
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:03,600
she used,

245
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,440
but she has completely
corrupted you now.

246
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:06,880
Does that mean

247
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,200
I'll look like this forever?

248
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,360
Why didn't you

249
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,600
tell me sooner?

250
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,200
How was I supposed to know

251
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,600
"corruption"

252
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,800
meant turning this dark?

253
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,100
Then how am I supposed

254
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,160
to face my wife?

255
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,520
You're really too innocent.

256
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,880
You're still thinking about your wife?

257
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,520
I already

258
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,760
sent her to the afterlife.

259
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,480
So you're the one who killed my wife.

260
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,200
She's in Youming City.

261
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,400
Let's go find her together.

262
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:32,160
That's the Lord of Youming City's
territory.

263
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,200
And you two think you can find her?

264
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:33,560
Hmph.

265
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,160
My benefactor

266
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,520
has limitless spiritual power now.

267
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,600
The Three Realms will all

268
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:39,000
bow before him.

269
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,600
Why should we fear

270
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,160
a mere Lord of Youming City?

271
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,880
Look at him right now.

272
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,560
Does he look like someone
with limitless spiritual power?

273
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,360
Besides,

274
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,640
even if he really finds

275
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,400
his wife,

276
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,800
when she sees him looking like this,

277
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,320
she'd be scared

278
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,040
out of her wits

279
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:50,600
and unable to reincarnate.

280
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,600
No way that won't happen.

281
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,200
Exactly.

282
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,280
Just look at your face.

283
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,560
Then I...

284
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,320
Scaring her to death would be better.

285
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,360
What did you just say?

286
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,320
Nothing.

287
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,280
No time to waste.

288
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,500
Let's hurry up

289
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:02,360
finish what we came here for,

290
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,560
then go find your wife.

291
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:04,600
Hold it.

292
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,400
With me here,

293
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,600
no one is leaving.

294
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:09,240
You lousy monk.

295
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:10,600
You don't have any spiritual power now.

296
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,960
How are you going to stop us?

297
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,760
Who said I don't have
my spiritual power?

298
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:14,400
The heavens

299
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,160
already restored

300
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,400
my powers.

301
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,360
Right?

302
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,360
Celestial maiden Yanzhi?

303
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,240
Oh.

304
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,400
That's right.

305
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,300
Didn't you

306
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,200
see me arrive?

307
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,000
I came here

308
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,560
to restore Dragon-Subduing
Arhat's spiritual power.

309
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,200
My power is boundless.

310
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,080
I am wise and mighty.

311
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,840
You've all witnessed it, haven't you?

312
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,200
Come on.

313
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,120
Surrender quietly,

314
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,160
so

315
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:33,000
I won't have to do it myself.

316
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,600
Hmph.

317
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,500
Hmph.

318
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:35,560
Perfect. I'll test

319
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,440
my current spiritual power.

320
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,640
Are you alright?

321
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,960
Yeah, I'm fine.

322
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,920
So you haven't regained
your spiritual power.

323
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,500
Benefactor,

324
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:47,900
let's not waste time with them.

325
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:49,520
The Ancestor is still waiting for us.

326
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:50,960
Alright.

327
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,040
Alas!

328
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,700
We have to stand here

329
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:57,120
and watch them get away.

330
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,760
Why?

331
00:10:58,840 --> 00:10:59,320
Oh!

332
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,120
You can't fly anymore, can you?

333
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:01,720
No worries.

334
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,300
You've got me.

335
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,000
Let's go.

336
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,500
Benefactor,

337
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,560
the Ancestor is imprisoned down there.

338
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:21,200
Alright.

339
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:36,600
Ah!

340
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:39,200
Hey, hey!

341
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,440
Don't mess around!

342
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,440
Beneath Xuanyuan Tomb,

343
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:44,120
an ancient fox spirit is sealed.

344
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,800
If released,

345
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,480
many people will die.

346
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,640
Monk, you're too late.

347
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,000
Welcome, Ancestor.

348
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:12,200
Wow!

349
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:15,800
I missed the scent of the mortal world.

350
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:28,510
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

351
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,770
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

352
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:35,570
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

353
00:12:35,620 --> 00:12:38,600
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

354
00:12:39,060 --> 00:12:45,810
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

355
00:12:45,830 --> 00:12:49,360
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

356
00:12:56,070 --> 00:12:59,270
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

357
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:02,530
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

358
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:05,840
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

359
00:13:05,850 --> 00:13:07,530
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

360
00:13:07,570 --> 00:13:09,450
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

361
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:11,010
♪I left my wife behind♪

362
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:12,610
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

363
00:13:12,650 --> 00:13:16,430
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

364
00:13:16,490 --> 00:13:17,570
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

365
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:19,670
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

366
00:13:19,710 --> 00:13:21,370
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

367
00:13:21,410 --> 00:13:23,240
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

368
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:26,600
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

369
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:29,870
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

370
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:33,000
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

371
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:36,370
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

372
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:40,030
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

373
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:43,380
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

374
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:46,490
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

375
00:13:47,070 --> 00:13:50,120
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

376
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:53,560
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

377
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:57,120
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

378
00:13:57,140 --> 00:14:00,600
♪You're just wasting your time♪

379
00:14:00,650 --> 00:14:03,570
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

380
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:05,230
♪And I just laugh happily♪

381
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:08,640
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

382
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:20,920
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

